Fixed all three review findings:

- `src/vfs.rs:326` — `directory_prefix` now normalizes `.` segments, so `path.list("./data")` sees files stored as `data/x.txt`; added a wasm test covering `./data`, `././data`, `data/.`, and `./data/`.
- `src/path.rs:162` — `root_with` now preserves the separator on a UNC share root, keeping it absolute; added a unit test.
- `src/path.rs:266` — `resolve` now refuses Windows prefix-without-root paths such as `C:foo` with `InvalidInput`; added a `cfg(windows)` test.

